function distPointSeg(p,a,b){tmp3.subVectors(b,a);const l=tmp3.lengthSq();let t=l?tmp4.subVectors(p,a).dot(tmp3)/l:0;t=clamp(t,0,1);
  return p.distanceTo(tmp4.copy(a).addScaledVector(tmp3,t));}
const bTip=V(),bMid=V(),bHalf=V(),segA=V(),segB=V(),coreW=V();
function checkBlade(b,i,dt){
  b.tip.getWorldPosition(bTip);b.mid.getWorldPosition(bMid);
  if(!b.valid){b.prev.copy(bTip);b.valid=true;return;}
  const speed=bTip.distanceTo(b.prev)/dt;bHalf.lerpVectors(b.prev,bTip,.5);b.prev.copy(bTip);
  b.whoosh-=dt;if(speed>7&&b.whoosh<=0&&inVR){sfx('slash');b.whoosh=.3;}
  if(speed<4.5)return;
  const samples=[bTip,bMid,bHalf];
  for(const g of giants){if(g.state==='dead')continue;
    const hx=g.root.position.x-bodyW.x,hz=g.root.position.z-bodyW.z;if(hx*hx+hz*hz>Math.pow(g.H*.8+4,2))continue;
    g.core.getWorldPosition(coreW);
    for(const s of samples)if(s.distanceTo(coreW)<g.coreR+.5){
      if(g.coreCool>0)break;
      if(g.coreHP>1){g.coreHP--;g.coreCool=.8;g.flinch=1.5;burst(coreW,60,9,g.coreCol);sfx('cut');buzz(i,1,120);
        showMessage('Basag ang mutya!',1.4,`${g.coreHP} more ${g.coreHP===1?'strike':'strikes'}`);}
      else{killGiant(g,coreW);buzz(i,1,120);}
      return;}
    for(const p of g.parts){if(p.cut)continue;
      p.piv.localToWorld(segA.set(0,0,0));p.piv.localToWorld(segB.set(0,-p.len,0));
      for(const s of samples){if(distPointSeg(s,segA,segB)<p.rad+.35){cutPart(g,p,s.clone());buzz(i,.9,90);break;}}}}
}

